<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Dec 26 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Dec 26 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $673 billion in the week to December 26 from $947 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     29.50		57.83</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     15.26		27.86</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  643.89	     889.17</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    126.67	     185.78</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	492.60	     698.51</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    180.79	     248.41</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
